sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Richman et al. (1975) & Tallinen et al. (2014, 2016) neo-Hookean constrained cortical expansion and sulcal creasing instability — MorphoEval overall 93.0/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) evaluation of `1975-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling.py` (overall weighted score: 93.1/100, up from 56.2/100 in v1). The remediated script relaxes a 2D coronal neo-Hookean multiplicative-growth (F = F_e G) cortical shell bonded to a soft subcortical white-matter core via L-BFGS-B energy minimization; reproduces the 11-species mammalian sulcal wavelength and Gyrification Index collapse across Rodentia, Carnivora, Artiodactyla, Cetacea, and Primates (r = 1.0000 for wavelength, r = 0.9985 for GI, log-log exponent alpha = 0.9993 ± 0.0005); validates Richman et al.'s (1975) polymicrogyria (h = 0.85 mm -> 85 sulci), lissencephaly (h = 6.50 mm, g < g_c -> 0 sulci, GI = 1.0000), and zero-growth (g = 1.00) controls; and segments the SHA-256-locked coronal human cerebral cortex specimen image (`cerebral_cortex_gyri_specimen.jpg`, 52 sulcal troughs, GI = 2.8115, CV = 0.3243). Overall 93.0/100 (faithfulness 92.6, reproducibility 93.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 91, Parameter expressivity 92, Morphometric validation 94, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 93, Reproducibility package 93. Output judged: docs/media/cortical_gyrification_folding_comparison.png: rendered output of 1975-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling.py at 8871db0, image/png, 821237 B, 2104×1452 px, artifact_sha256 b39586ccf22a61152ce3e5d36ae5410c69d36efd3669d69ad5675ae5dd5a0519 (sha256 b39586ccf22a61152ce3e5d36ae5410c69d36efd3669d69ad5675ae5dd5a0519), spec_fingerprint 90353ad40be0c49263b8cded1ab4fed2933fe58ce57cedb91cc5cc5a4ac29ad0. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 90353ad40be0c49263b8cded1ab4fed2933fe58ce57cedb91cc5cc5a4ac29ad0; artifact_sha256: b39586ccf22a61152ce3e5d36ae5410c69d36efd3669d69ad5675ae5dd5a0519; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/cortical_gyrification_folding/cerebral_cortex_gyri_specimen.jpg=ff9a25e993fd5aad..., datasets/cortical_gyrification_folding/cortical_gyrification_folding_reference.json=94947373ac49d97d..., datasets/cortical_gyrification_folding/paper_citations.bib=56bc1d0beedebe37..., datasets/cortical_gyrification_folding/scout_manifest.json=7f5410ff8ad2c1ee...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-cortical-gyrification-folding-audit." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Extend the 2D coronal neo-Hookean shell solver to a full 3D tetrahedral fetal brain mesh generated from gestational MRI templates (Tallinen et al. 2016 Nature Physics) to resolve 3D Y-shaped sulcal junctions and regional cortical thickness gradients." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.93"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (MorphoEval Autonomous Loop Slot 061 Pass 2 Assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

